      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795188382670,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- The storage Engine Consists a Versioned / Time-Stamped values\n * but the exposed interface via Tx Interface + Tx Workspace keep that knowledge private \n * Knowledge of versioning is not exposed to the client through Tx Interface\n * Tx Workspace Hides that fact, access engine via provisioned Time-stamp obtained from MVCC Control plane",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
