      "originalText": "- The storage Engine Consists a Versioned / Time-Stamped values\n * but the exposed interface via Tx Interface + Tx Workspace keep that knowledge private \n * Knowledge of versioning is not exposed to the client through Tx Interface\n * Tx Workspace Hides that fact, access engine via provisioned Time-stamp obtained from MVCC Control plane",
